'''Match rules'''<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.efl.com/carabao-cup/about-the-carabao-cup/carabao-cup-rules--regulations |title=Regulations |website=EFL.com |publisher=English Football League |access-date=13 January 2022 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220113093144/https://www.efl.com/carabao-cup/about-the-carabao-cup/carabao-cup-rules--regulations/ |archive-date=13 January 2022}}</ref>
